## Compare/combine results of VisiumHD liver sections with Vizgen data

* 0: contains the color palettes of the cell types (both for Vizgen and liver atlas), as well as plotting themes
* 1_1: Creates Supplementary Figure 4.2
* 1_2: Creates Supplementary Figure 4.3
* 2_1: Creates artificial bins in Vizgen data, calculates intersection between the bins and segmented cells, and calculates the proportions
* 2_2: Uses shapes exported from 2_1 to create Figure 4.1 and Figure 4.4a-c
* 3_1: Creates Figure 4.4d and Supplementary Figure 4.4
* 3_2: Creates Figure 4.5 and Supplementary Figures 4.6-4.8
* 3_3: Can be ignored, not used
* 4: Creates Figure 4.6
* 5: Creates Figure 5.1
* ex: Analyses that were attempted but not included in the chapter, can be ignored
